// Ported slice of tests/compiler.Tests/TypeCheckingTests.cs.
// Each Impl keeps the embedded Stark program verbatim from the C# raw string and
// runs it through the closest compile helper, returning true when the original
// xUnit assertions would hold. PORT-NOTE comments flag assertions the Stark
// helpers cannot express (TypeCheckModel artifact probes: FunctionPointerPromotions,
// AddressTakenFunctions, IndirectCalls, ClosureLambdas, LambdaCaptures, NamedTypes
// layout facts, Globals types, integer-range endpoints, per-target data models)
// that were reduced to the nearest succeed/diagnostic signal.

